1
00:00:00,510 --> 00:00:01,870
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:03,540
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,910
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:09,350
(Episode 55)

5
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:15,890
Congratulations.

6
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:19,120
May your future together
always be filled with joy.

7
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:21,690
Please give them another
big round of applause.

8
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,660
My daughter...

9
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:29,300
You are a beauty.

10
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:20,080
Yes, Director.

11
00:01:20,550 --> 00:01:21,550
Did you lose him?

12
00:01:22,220 --> 00:01:23,220
Yes, I believe so.

13
00:01:23,350 --> 00:01:26,320
What were you doing
while he was running wild?

14
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:28,860
I'm sorry.

15
00:01:29,230 --> 00:01:31,230
Find An Guk Cheol
right this instant.

16
00:01:32,730 --> 00:01:33,730
Yes, ma'am.

17
00:01:37,770 --> 00:01:39,000
That scumbag.

18
00:01:42,970 --> 00:01:44,540
Director, here you are.

19
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:46,850
- Hey.
- Let's take a photo together.

20
00:01:47,650 --> 00:01:48,810
- You and me?
- Yes.

21
00:01:49,110 --> 00:01:50,580
Did you take one with the Chairman?

22
00:01:50,650 --> 00:01:52,720
Yes, I already took one
with Mom and Dad.

23
00:01:53,850 --> 00:01:56,220
Our Hae Ra finally got
her wish granted.

24
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,360
That's right.

25
00:01:58,420 --> 00:02:00,860
I've checked off
a major requirement in my life.

26
00:02:01,430 --> 00:02:04,030
Was Chief Cha a major requirement?

27
00:02:05,530 --> 00:02:07,500
What do you like so much
about him anyway?

28
00:02:09,470 --> 00:02:10,600
That he's a bit pathetic?

29
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:13,170
I like that he makes me
stand out more.

30
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:18,240
Prince Charming was definitely
never your type, Hae Ra.

31
00:02:18,410 --> 00:02:20,480
I absolutely hate that type.

32
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,280
Right.

33
00:02:22,350 --> 00:02:24,880
Being with someone too impressive
only stresses you out.

34
00:02:25,420 --> 00:02:26,890
Someone with a modest background...

35
00:02:26,950 --> 00:02:28,920
and modest ambition
is much easier to be around.

36
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:29,950
Right?

37
00:02:29,990 --> 00:02:32,090
Director, aren't I wise?

38
00:02:32,390 --> 00:02:33,660
That you are.

39
00:02:34,230 --> 00:02:35,790
After all, whose daughter are you?

40
00:02:36,860 --> 00:02:38,500
- Come on, let's go take photos.
- Okay.

41
00:02:58,180 --> 00:03:00,290
So, where did you say
you were traveling?

42
00:03:00,450 --> 00:03:03,050
Seok Jin's too busy
for us to go overseas,

43
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,220
so we're just staying
in the country.

44
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:07,060
Well, you'll be going
on a honeymoon next year anyway.

45
00:03:07,190 --> 00:03:08,230
A honeymoon?

46
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:10,230
Does that mean I'm really
getting married next year?

47
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:12,700
Yes, your father
gave his permission.

48
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:15,130
No way. Since when?

49
00:03:15,770 --> 00:03:17,500
Dad, are you really okay with it?

50
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:21,970
If I said no,
would you not marry Chief Cha?

51
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:27,650
I'm only giving you what you want
so you'll get off my back.

52
00:03:27,650 --> 00:03:28,980
Thank you, Dad.

53
00:03:30,250 --> 00:03:31,450
Anyway,

54
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:34,220
if you head out on this trip,
who'll look after So Yeon?

55
00:03:34,550 --> 00:03:35,950
Is there someone to look after her?

56
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:38,760
How about having her stay
at our place?

57
00:03:38,820 --> 00:03:40,730
As if that would work.

58
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:43,190
Think of how uncomfortable
So Yeon would feel.

59
00:03:43,490 --> 00:03:46,030
Why do you only think of yourself?

60
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,700
Is that so?

61
00:03:48,700 --> 00:03:49,970
Instead,

62
00:03:50,030 --> 00:03:52,470
why don't you drop by her place,
Director Joo?

63
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:54,410
Should I?

64
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:57,110
I just need to drop by for meals
and help her get settled for bed.

65
00:03:57,140 --> 00:03:58,140
Right.

66
00:03:58,540 --> 00:04:01,950
So Yeon's much closer to you
than to me anyway.

67
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:08,320
You still haven't found him?

68
00:04:08,450 --> 00:04:11,560
No. We searched the local
gambling arcades and gambling dens,

69
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:13,360
but no one has seen An Guk Cheol.

70
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,590
Darn it.

71
00:04:14,660 --> 00:04:17,100
I should've had him committed
right then and there.

72
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:21,070
I have people looking for him,
so we'll track him down soon.

73
00:04:21,870 --> 00:04:23,400
Find him as soon as possible.

74
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:26,100
There's no telling
what that man will do.

75
00:04:34,550 --> 00:04:38,850
Director, if you have a moment,
could I see you briefly?

76
00:04:40,390 --> 00:04:41,890
Why does she keep...

77
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:43,420
contacting me?

78
00:04:43,860 --> 00:04:46,990
Give someone an inch,
and she thinks she's all that.

79
00:04:54,430 --> 00:04:56,670
Sure, let's meet.

80
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,540
Where would be good for you?

81
00:05:05,610 --> 00:05:07,350
(Account Holder: Ko Eun Seol)

82
00:05:09,550 --> 00:05:11,050
Gosh, it's chilly.

83
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,790
What's this bankbook?

84
00:05:17,690 --> 00:05:18,690
Shoot.

85
00:05:23,930 --> 00:05:26,230
A 100-dollar deposit like clockwork
every month?

86
00:05:27,700 --> 00:05:29,430
You've been stashing away
this kind of money?

87
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:32,070
Leave it alone.

88
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,940
Mind your own business.

89
00:05:35,570 --> 00:05:39,080
I seriously won't give you
a single penny anymore, Mom.

90
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:42,480
You can talk after
you've actually given me a penny.

91
00:05:42,910 --> 00:05:45,480
Anyway, this is strictly
off-limits, okay?

92
00:05:45,880 --> 00:05:47,450
Don't even eye it.

93
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,590
If you touch this, I swear...

94
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:51,720
I'll never see you again.

95
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:55,330
- You've been warned.
- We spoiled Eun Seol so much...

96
00:05:55,330 --> 00:05:57,400
that she has zero manners.

97
00:05:57,830 --> 00:05:59,730
She's moving out just because
I asked her to get a loan?

98
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:03,800
This is all because
you raised her wrong.

99
00:06:04,340 --> 00:06:06,500
And you did such a wonderful job
raising me, right?

100
00:06:06,570 --> 00:06:08,970
Of course I did.
What more could I have done?

101
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:10,580
You must be so proud.

102
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:12,840
- Why, you...
- Good for you.

103
00:06:13,210 --> 00:06:14,550
You little punk.

104
00:06:14,550 --> 00:06:15,680
Who are you calling a punk?

105
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:20,020
Time's just flying today, isn't it?

106
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:22,520
- Is it lunchtime already?
- Tell me about it.

107
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,220
Maybe it's because
we're not stressed.

108
00:06:25,490 --> 00:06:27,130
Work seems to be going smoothly.

109
00:06:28,330 --> 00:06:29,660
It would've been even better...

110
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:31,630
if Ms. Kang's trip
took her abroad instead.

111
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,900
- I mean, she's loaded.
- I know, right?

112
00:06:34,100 --> 00:06:35,800
A month away would've been perfect.

113
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:38,940
Eun Seol.

114
00:06:39,300 --> 00:06:41,070
I bet your day feels
pretty relaxed, too.

115
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:43,370
Yes, it does.

116
00:06:47,550 --> 00:06:49,450
I've been thinking.

117
00:06:50,350 --> 00:06:51,780
How about you move out...

118
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:54,220
of your current place?

119
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:56,220
What?

120
00:06:57,050 --> 00:06:58,690
If it's okay with you,

121
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:02,490
I'd like to get you
a studio apartment.

122
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:06,600
It'd also be wonderful
to study design professionally.

123
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:13,200
(PR Director Joo Mi Ran)

124
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:14,410
Yes?

125
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,140
Come on in, Eun Seol.

126
00:07:19,810 --> 00:07:21,850
Do you have a moment?

127
00:07:21,950 --> 00:07:23,650
Of course I do.

128
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,120
Have a seat.

129
00:07:31,660 --> 00:07:32,960
I came to ask...

130
00:07:33,220 --> 00:07:36,190
about that studio apartment
you mentioned before.

131
00:07:36,730 --> 00:07:37,730
Sure.

132
00:07:38,230 --> 00:07:40,230
Does the offer still stand?

133
00:07:40,930 --> 00:07:42,100
Of course.

134
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:45,170
I was secretly waiting
for your decision.

135
00:07:45,500 --> 00:07:48,110
I couldn't wait for you
to move out of there.

136
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:50,510
So, have you made up your mind?

137
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,040
Yes.

138
00:07:54,010 --> 00:07:57,080
Good. You made the right choice.

139
00:07:57,620 --> 00:07:58,780
That way,

140
00:07:58,950 --> 00:08:01,490
it'll be much easier for me
to see you often.

141
00:08:03,290 --> 00:08:04,820
And also,

142
00:08:05,660 --> 00:08:07,330
about that design school...

143
00:08:09,860 --> 00:08:11,230
I want to start preparing for it.

144
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:13,800
Wonderful.

145
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:17,070
It's better to leave
as soon as possible.

146
00:08:17,100 --> 00:08:19,640
I'm so glad you made that decision.

147
00:08:21,540 --> 00:08:24,610
Don't worry about a single thing
about studying abroad.

148
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:25,640
I'll handle it all.

149
00:08:25,740 --> 00:08:27,510
Just take it easy and relax.

150
00:08:27,810 --> 00:08:30,350
I'll look for a studio apartment
near the office.

151
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:33,480
As for the tuition,
I've been saving up a little...

152
00:08:33,550 --> 00:08:37,360
No, absolutely not.
I'll take care of all that.

153
00:08:38,590 --> 00:08:42,130
I'm just grateful you grew up
so well without a mom.

154
00:08:42,630 --> 00:08:44,730
The studio apartment
and study abroad expenses?

155
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:47,970
Don't worry about that.
I'll cover everything.

156
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:52,440
All your life,

157
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:56,010
you've never been taken care of
like this, have you?

158
00:08:58,740 --> 00:09:01,310
From now on,
you just take what comes.

159
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:04,320
I'll handle everything for you.

160
00:09:19,530 --> 00:09:20,530
Yes, hello?

161
00:09:20,870 --> 00:09:22,970
Hello, is this the family
of Seo Hyun Jae?

162
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:26,200
Yes, it is.

163
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:29,640
I'm calling from Healing Gym...

164
00:09:30,410 --> 00:09:32,910
because we need to clear out
his personal belongings.

165
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,380
Oh, I see.

166
00:09:36,250 --> 00:09:40,050
His number was disconnected,
so I reached out to his family.

167
00:09:40,950 --> 00:09:42,350
Please come pick them up
within one week.

168
00:09:43,290 --> 00:09:44,420
All right, I will.

169
00:09:50,700 --> 00:09:52,960
What is it? What was that about?

170
00:09:53,830 --> 00:09:56,270
The gym told me to come
pick up Hyun Jae's things.

171
00:09:59,170 --> 00:10:00,170
I'll go.

172
00:10:00,970 --> 00:10:02,270
Hyun Jae...

173
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:05,040
worked out really hard.

174
00:10:05,740 --> 00:10:06,940
He said that if he broke down,

175
00:10:07,010 --> 00:10:08,980
he wouldn't be able
to protect me and Teun Teun.

176
00:10:09,850 --> 00:10:12,250
No matter how tired he was,
he never skipped a single workout.

177
00:10:16,420 --> 00:10:17,420
Tell me more.

178
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:19,390
Tell me more stories
about Attorney Seo.

179
00:10:23,690 --> 00:10:26,860
Whenever he got a bad cold,
he didn't come home.

180
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:28,970
He was afraid of passing it
to Teun Teun and me.

181
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:33,000
One day, even with a burning fever,
he slept in his car.

182
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:36,310
He suffered through
the whole night...

183
00:10:36,370 --> 00:10:38,680
and only came home
after his fever broke.

184
00:10:41,150 --> 00:10:42,850
He truly loved you, boss.

185
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:45,580
What else?

186
00:10:49,220 --> 00:10:50,990
Are you really curious?

187
00:10:51,490 --> 00:10:53,520
You're just going along with me
to be nice, aren't you?

188
00:10:54,390 --> 00:10:57,360
No, I'm genuinely curious.

189
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:02,800
I need to know
how deeply he loved you...

190
00:11:02,930 --> 00:11:04,200
so I can learn from that.

191
00:11:08,670 --> 00:11:10,980
You peel fruit so well, So Yeon.

192
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:13,310
You're better at it than me.

193
00:11:14,180 --> 00:11:18,250
My husband really loved apples.

194
00:11:18,650 --> 00:11:22,390
So I can peel them
even with my eyes closed.

195
00:11:23,220 --> 00:11:24,220
Watch this.

196
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:26,390
That isn't necessary.

197
00:11:30,190 --> 00:11:31,200
So Yeon,

198
00:11:32,700 --> 00:11:35,770
what kind of person
was Chief Cha's father?

199
00:11:36,030 --> 00:11:37,300
My husband?

200
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,410
He was a warm person.

201
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:45,440
He was also extremely good
at his job.

202
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:51,150
That's why even
the former chairman of Cheongma...

203
00:11:51,150 --> 00:11:52,950
was really fond of him.

204
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:55,490
The former chairman of Cheongma?

205
00:11:56,190 --> 00:11:59,660
Yes.
He got promoted really fast, too.

206
00:12:02,130 --> 00:12:04,700
He must have been
remarkably talented.

207
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:06,230
Of course.

208
00:12:06,930 --> 00:12:10,430
So he had a lot of jealous friends.

209
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:14,140
Hae Ra's dad was pretty sulky
about it.

210
00:12:17,940 --> 00:12:19,340
I see.

211
00:12:23,510 --> 00:12:25,780
It's me. How did it go?

212
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:28,090
Just as you asked,

213
00:12:28,190 --> 00:12:29,850
I transferred it
to the overseas account.

214
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:33,490
Good work. Thanks.

215
00:12:34,090 --> 00:12:36,690
Everything's taken care of, right?

216
00:12:37,390 --> 00:12:39,560
Yes, absolutely. It's all done.

217
00:12:42,430 --> 00:12:44,870
(Oh Tae Seop)

218
00:13:07,390 --> 00:13:08,460
Aren't you going to shower?

219
00:13:09,230 --> 00:13:10,460
I took one earlier.

220
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:12,230
Is that what you're sleeping in?

221
00:13:12,430 --> 00:13:14,300
Yes. This is comfortable.

222
00:14:17,230 --> 00:14:18,230
Come on.

223
00:15:06,340 --> 00:15:08,210
I'm a bit tired tonight.

224
00:15:11,050 --> 00:15:12,320
Let's just turn in early.

225
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:37,010
(Liked by 539hel and others)

226
00:15:42,350 --> 00:15:43,650
(Ten years together,
and this is their very first trip?)

227
00:15:43,710 --> 00:15:44,920
(Now, this is true love.)

228
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:46,150
(Ten years later
and they still get butterflies!)

229
00:15:46,150 --> 00:15:47,180
(A first trip
after ten years together?)

230
00:15:47,180 --> 00:15:48,190
(The photos say it all.)

231
00:15:58,830 --> 00:16:00,960
Eun Seol, are you busy?

232
00:16:01,330 --> 00:16:03,500
No, did you want to talk?

233
00:16:03,830 --> 00:16:06,000
Yes. Come sit here.

234
00:16:15,250 --> 00:16:16,350
Here.

235
00:16:18,250 --> 00:16:19,950
What's this?

236
00:16:21,020 --> 00:16:23,220
When your mom was still alive,

237
00:16:23,690 --> 00:16:26,290
she saved up this money
for your wedding.

238
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:28,790
No matter how tough things got,

239
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:31,460
she put in 100 dollars
every single month.

240
00:16:35,230 --> 00:16:38,170
Even after she passed away,
I should've kept contributing.

241
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:39,640
I'm sorry.

242
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,210
If you're going to move out,

243
00:16:43,870 --> 00:16:45,510
you'll need a good chunk of money.

244
00:16:46,210 --> 00:16:48,410
I thought this might help,
even just a little.

245
00:16:50,250 --> 00:16:51,280
Dad...

246
00:16:52,950 --> 00:16:55,750
You held on to this all this time?

247
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:59,160
I just couldn't bring myself
to cash it out.

248
00:17:00,860 --> 00:17:03,290
Even when we were out on the street,

249
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:06,030
I pretended this money didn't exist
and kept it safe.

250
00:17:06,430 --> 00:17:11,200
So take this money now,
and live a little more comfortably.

251
00:17:17,780 --> 00:17:19,180
(Study in World)

252
00:17:30,220 --> 00:17:31,320
(Account Holder: Ko Eun Seol)

253
00:17:50,410 --> 00:17:51,610
Mom...

254
00:18:11,090 --> 00:18:13,230
These are definitely women's gloves.

255
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:15,930
Judging by the hand size, too.

256
00:18:19,140 --> 00:18:21,970
Doesn't that mean a woman
was also at the scene?

257
00:18:44,460 --> 00:18:45,530
Well...

258
00:18:46,300 --> 00:18:47,630
I'm back.

259
00:18:48,870 --> 00:18:49,930
If you were coming at this hour,

260
00:18:50,070 --> 00:18:51,600
you should've just spent
the night there.

261
00:18:51,900 --> 00:18:54,000
Did you take good care of So Yeon?

262
00:18:54,610 --> 00:18:57,210
Yes, I made sure she fell asleep
before leaving.

263
00:18:57,470 --> 00:18:59,010
You're working so hard,
Director Joo.

264
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:01,580
Thank you for filling in
for my wife.

265
00:19:02,950 --> 00:19:03,950
Not at all.

266
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,150
Director Joo.

267
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:09,920
Clear your schedule this weekend.
Let's go for a drive.

268
00:19:11,620 --> 00:19:12,860
Where to?

269
00:19:13,620 --> 00:19:16,790
Well, we can just go
wherever our hearts take us.

270
00:19:16,860 --> 00:19:19,660
There's no need to set
a specific destination.

271
00:19:20,030 --> 00:19:21,500
Sure, sounds great.

272
00:19:22,330 --> 00:19:26,340
Also, I left something
in your room for you.

273
00:19:27,940 --> 00:19:30,140
I think you'll really like it.

274
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:32,240
I'll probably like it, too.

275
00:19:45,490 --> 00:19:46,590
Seriously...

276
00:19:53,530 --> 00:19:57,230
His taste is so old-fashioned.

277
00:19:58,300 --> 00:20:00,500
He picked out something
that's so him.

278
00:20:01,810 --> 00:20:05,010
With all the pretty options
these days, he gets me this?

279
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:11,980
Fine, I'll wear it for him.

280
00:20:16,790 --> 00:20:19,020
The scholarship program's
promo video turned out great.

281
00:20:19,090 --> 00:20:21,560
Yes, the interview
was edited well, too.

282
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:23,760
- Jun Pyo, prepare those materials.
- Yes, ma'am.

283
00:20:42,280 --> 00:20:44,350
When is the next interview
scheduled?

284
00:20:44,820 --> 00:20:46,280
For early next month.

285
00:20:46,750 --> 00:20:48,220
Once the candidates are selected,

286
00:20:48,550 --> 00:20:50,220
I'll share the detailed schedule
with you.

287
00:20:50,650 --> 00:20:51,660
Okay.

288
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:55,430
Eun Seol.

289
00:20:57,490 --> 00:20:59,160
Did something happen...

290
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:01,330
between you and Director Joo?

291
00:21:01,330 --> 00:21:03,770
No, nothing happened.

292
00:21:04,740 --> 00:21:08,570
By the looks of it today,
you two seemed quite close.

293
00:21:10,610 --> 00:21:13,010
We're working
on the scholarship program together.

294
00:21:13,140 --> 00:21:15,010
Working together
just brought us closer.

295
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:18,980
And she was also a friend
of my late mom.

296
00:21:19,520 --> 00:21:20,580
Right.

297
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:22,590
I didn't notice it before,

298
00:21:22,820 --> 00:21:25,120
but you two seem
to have gotten a lot closer.

299
00:21:27,060 --> 00:21:30,590
I knew she was a good person,
but I recently realized...

300
00:21:31,530 --> 00:21:34,030
she's actually very warmhearted.

301
00:21:35,030 --> 00:21:36,430
You said so yourself,
Secretary Choi,

302
00:21:36,670 --> 00:21:37,900
that she's like a mother to you.

303
00:21:38,700 --> 00:21:40,070
Yes, I did.

304
00:22:06,530 --> 00:22:09,230
What is it? Am I too pretty?

305
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:13,470
Are you wondering how someone
could be this pretty in the morning?

306
00:22:14,740 --> 00:22:17,170
My face never gets puffy
in the morning.

307
00:22:18,140 --> 00:22:19,640
Things like this are all genetic.

308
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:23,050
Should I thank my mom for this?

309
00:22:27,820 --> 00:22:28,820
Kang Hae Ra.

310
00:22:32,160 --> 00:22:33,420
What do you think of me?

311
00:22:34,090 --> 00:22:35,360
Isn't it obvious?

312
00:22:36,030 --> 00:22:37,930
I think of you as my future husband.

313
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:48,570
Was Chief Cha a major requirement?

314
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:51,410
What do you like so much
about him anyway?

315
00:22:51,580 --> 00:22:52,640
That he's a bit pathetic?

316
00:22:53,110 --> 00:22:55,210
I like that he makes me
stand out more.

317
00:22:55,550 --> 00:22:59,280
Prince Charming was definitely
never your type, Hae Ra.

318
00:22:59,320 --> 00:23:01,150
I absolutely hate that type.

319
00:23:02,220 --> 00:23:03,220
Right.

320
00:23:03,220 --> 00:23:05,660
Being with someone too impressive
only stresses you out.

321
00:23:06,360 --> 00:23:07,790
Someone with a modest background...

322
00:23:07,860 --> 00:23:09,990
and modest ambition
is much easier to be around.

323
00:23:16,700 --> 00:23:18,840
Who's the gift for?

324
00:23:18,840 --> 00:23:20,970
Oh, it's my mom's birthday today.

325
00:23:21,370 --> 00:23:23,240
She always tells me to save money,

326
00:23:23,470 --> 00:23:25,110
except when I buy her gifts.

327
00:23:25,340 --> 00:23:28,750
Of course.
No parent turns down a gift.

328
00:23:38,820 --> 00:23:40,920
Excuse me,
could you show me this one?

329
00:23:41,020 --> 00:23:42,960
This one? Hold on.

330
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,680
We're closed for the day.

331
00:24:01,310 --> 00:24:02,380
What are you doing here
at this hour?

332
00:24:03,780 --> 00:24:05,150
I came to talk to Mi Rae.

333
00:24:06,680 --> 00:24:08,520
Do you have a minute?

334
00:24:09,220 --> 00:24:11,290
I'll head out first, then.

335
00:24:24,170 --> 00:24:25,170
Mi Rae.

336
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:28,000
I'm sorry.

337
00:24:32,040 --> 00:24:33,040
You're right.

338
00:24:35,150 --> 00:24:36,180
Attorney Seo...

339
00:24:38,620 --> 00:24:40,620
probably suffered a lot
because of me.

340
00:24:44,020 --> 00:24:47,220
Even if it's late,
I wanted to apologize.

341
00:24:48,790 --> 00:24:49,990
I'm truly sorry.

342
00:24:52,330 --> 00:24:53,360
Not long ago,

343
00:24:55,430 --> 00:24:57,570
your father came to see me.

344
00:24:59,000 --> 00:25:00,870
He even got on his knees
in front of me.

345
00:25:04,610 --> 00:25:06,310
As a parent with a son myself,

346
00:25:06,940 --> 00:25:09,110
I understood how he felt.

347
00:25:10,980 --> 00:25:14,380
He probably feels much guiltier
than you do.

348
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:19,160
So I'll try...

349
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:21,190
to understand.

350
00:25:24,490 --> 00:25:27,030
Right now, seeing you
honestly isn't easy.

351
00:25:28,900 --> 00:25:30,300
Still, I'll make an effort.

352
00:25:31,500 --> 00:25:33,270
So don't feel guilty anymore.

353
00:25:35,070 --> 00:25:37,610
Your father already apologized
for you.

354
00:25:41,340 --> 00:25:42,410
I'm so sorry...

355
00:25:44,980 --> 00:25:46,250
and thank you, Mi Rae.

356
00:25:47,580 --> 00:25:49,220
If you're truly sorry,

357
00:25:51,090 --> 00:25:52,690
just don't forget Hyun Jae.

358
00:25:54,460 --> 00:25:58,460
Remembering him for a long time
will bring him some peace.

359
00:25:59,960 --> 00:26:01,730
I don't mean remember the guilt.

360
00:26:03,030 --> 00:26:05,000
Just remember
that there was someone...

361
00:26:05,600 --> 00:26:07,270
who sacrificed himself for you.

362
00:26:08,910 --> 00:26:11,680
Don't forget that, okay?

363
00:26:13,510 --> 00:26:14,510
Okay.

364
00:26:15,650 --> 00:26:16,750
I definitely won't.

365
00:26:42,310 --> 00:26:44,610
I could never forget you,
Attorney Seo.

366
00:26:47,310 --> 00:26:49,080
So I'll find out the truth.

367
00:26:51,310 --> 00:26:53,080
Even the injustice
surrounding your death...

368
00:26:54,780 --> 00:26:56,620
I'll uncover it all.

369
00:27:05,530 --> 00:27:06,530
(AI Image Search)

370
00:27:09,600 --> 00:27:12,970
(Cheongma)

371
00:27:27,450 --> 00:27:30,190
Director, do you have a moment?

372
00:27:38,730 --> 00:27:40,100
Sure, I'm free.

373
00:27:42,830 --> 00:27:44,530
Look at her acting friendly.

374
00:27:46,370 --> 00:27:48,200
There's no way
she caught on already.

375
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:54,680
What's this?

376
00:27:55,780 --> 00:27:57,450
Thank you so much
for looking into...

377
00:27:57,750 --> 00:27:59,350
my study abroad program.

378
00:28:00,620 --> 00:28:04,690
It's the least a mother can do.
You didn't have to get me anything.

379
00:28:05,320 --> 00:28:07,690
I really wanted to
repay you someday.

380
00:28:09,630 --> 00:28:12,560
Then, Eun Seol,
will you pin it on me?

381
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:14,400
That would make it
even more special.

382
00:28:15,970 --> 00:28:17,700
Sure, let me do that for you.

383
00:28:26,380 --> 00:28:29,880
Wait, isn't this Swerang?

384
00:28:30,350 --> 00:28:32,620
How did you know I like this brand?

385
00:28:32,980 --> 00:28:34,050
Really?

386
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:37,290
I think it looks great
with your jacket.

387
00:28:39,220 --> 00:28:41,420
Actually, this jacket
is from Swerang, too.

388
00:28:41,990 --> 00:28:44,430
You really have great taste,
Eun Seol.

389
00:28:54,670 --> 00:28:56,410
(Posts)

390
00:28:56,470 --> 00:28:58,610
You're really gorgeous, aren't you?

391
00:28:59,780 --> 00:29:03,450
I wonder whose daughter she is
to be so classy.

392
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:05,420
Her nose is just like mine.

393
00:29:07,050 --> 00:29:08,750
Her eyes look just like her mom's,

394
00:29:08,820 --> 00:29:10,650
and these lips...

395
00:29:11,090 --> 00:29:13,990
Right, they're just like
my late mom's.

396
00:29:16,030 --> 00:29:18,660
Her proportions put Venus to shame.

397
00:29:25,140 --> 00:29:27,940
Actually, this jacket
is from Swerang, too.

398
00:29:36,010 --> 00:29:37,010
Ji Soo.

399
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:40,780
Do you happen to know this brand?

400
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:43,750
Wait. These are from Swerang.

401
00:29:44,020 --> 00:29:46,320
A few years back,
this came out as a VIP exclusive.

402
00:29:46,390 --> 00:29:48,320
Was it capped at
around 100 people or so?

403
00:29:49,360 --> 00:29:51,900
Anyway, where did you get this,
Eun Seol?

404
00:29:52,300 --> 00:29:53,300
Is it the real deal?

405
00:29:55,700 --> 00:29:57,830
Someone just asked me
to check for them.

406
00:29:58,000 --> 00:30:00,770
Seriously.
I thought you owned a pair.

407
00:30:01,270 --> 00:30:03,010
There isn't a luxury brand
you don't know, Ji Soo.

408
00:30:03,510 --> 00:30:05,610
I know, but in this case,
ignorance is bliss.

409
00:30:10,080 --> 00:30:12,880
It was limited to 100 VIPs?

410
00:30:34,800 --> 00:30:35,810
Go on in, then.

411
00:30:36,410 --> 00:30:37,610
You aren't coming inside for a bit?

412
00:30:38,780 --> 00:30:39,910
No, I'll just get going.

413
00:30:40,780 --> 00:30:42,650
Okay. Get some rest, Seok Jin.

414
00:31:01,360 --> 00:31:03,970
My dear Hae Ra,
are you returning from a trip?

415
00:31:05,070 --> 00:31:06,070
Who are you?

416
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:08,610
Hae Ra,

417
00:31:09,910 --> 00:31:10,910
I'm your dad.

418
00:31:14,880 --> 00:31:16,410
Wait, from that coffee spill?

419
00:31:19,580 --> 00:31:21,550
Get lost right now,
or I'll call the police.

420
00:31:22,950 --> 00:31:25,290
Right, you must be pretty surprised.

421
00:31:25,460 --> 00:31:28,190
Here, take a look at this first.

422
00:31:33,560 --> 00:31:36,170
(Paternity Test Results:
An Guk Cheol, Kang Hae Ra)

423
00:31:36,230 --> 00:31:38,870
(A 99.999 percent genetic match)

424
00:31:40,740 --> 00:31:42,570
You crazy bum,
who are you trying to scam?

425
00:31:44,370 --> 00:31:45,440
How's this for proof?

426
00:31:58,420 --> 00:31:59,420
Director Joo?

427
00:32:02,690 --> 00:32:04,860
All right, let's wrap up
today's meeting here.

428
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:06,430
- Yes, ma'am.
- Sure.

429
00:32:06,800 --> 00:32:08,060
I'll get going first, then.

430
00:32:08,060 --> 00:32:10,100
- Right, good work today.
- Thank you.

431
00:32:16,210 --> 00:32:17,440
Aren't you leaving, Director?

432
00:32:17,610 --> 00:32:19,580
I'm going to look over
these documents a bit more.

433
00:32:20,180 --> 00:32:22,180
- All right, then.
- Okay.

434
00:32:34,620 --> 00:32:35,630
Hello?

435
00:32:43,870 --> 00:32:45,800
Wait, my pencil case.

436
00:32:50,610 --> 00:32:53,940
That's why I said to find
the cheapest place.

437
00:32:55,240 --> 00:32:57,610
Don't bother considering
safety or infrastructure.

438
00:32:57,610 --> 00:32:58,880
Just find the cheapest option.

439
00:33:00,320 --> 00:33:02,720
Study abroad or not, she's an adult.

440
00:33:05,090 --> 00:33:06,660
Just cut corners.

441
00:33:12,060 --> 00:33:13,600
Seriously.

442
00:33:14,630 --> 00:33:17,630
Why do I have to deal with this crap
all because of Ko Eun Seol?

443
00:33:40,490 --> 00:33:44,360
(A Trap Called Desire)

444
00:33:44,430 --> 00:33:45,800
That's how you really feel,
isn't it?

445
00:33:45,800 --> 00:33:47,160
Maybe it's for the best.

446
00:33:47,430 --> 00:33:49,130
I started this knowing everything
from the start anyway.

447
00:33:49,200 --> 00:33:52,500
If I dig into Oh Tae Seop,
who killed Chief Cha's father,

448
00:33:52,600 --> 00:33:54,040
something might turn up.

449
00:33:54,340 --> 00:33:56,440
Eun Seol,
is there anything you want?

450
00:33:56,510 --> 00:33:58,140
The gloves you're wearing, Director.

451
00:33:58,140 --> 00:34:00,340
They look really pretty to me.

452
00:34:00,340 --> 00:34:02,710
My daughter,
were you looking for your dad?

453
00:34:02,750 --> 00:34:04,950
You aren't Kang Hae Ra,
you're An Hae Ra.

454
00:34:05,010 --> 00:34:06,020
Shut it!

455
00:34:06,450 --> 00:34:07,520
From the beginning,

456
00:34:07,750 --> 00:34:09,220
I've been the only daughter
of Cheongma Group.

457
00:34:09,390 --> 00:34:11,050
Who do you think you are,
Director Joo? My mom?

458
00:34:11,420 --> 00:34:13,420
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
